1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,234
One Ray Allen shot changed the story of LeBron James.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:08,746
Miami down three. San Antonio seconds from the championship.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:13,248
LeBron missed the three. Chris Bosh grabbed the rebound and found Allen.

4
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:17,753
Backpedal. Behind the line. Tie game, with five point two left.

5
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,250
Miami survived overtime. LeBron finished the job in Game Seven.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:26,754
Without it? Likely one title and three defeats in four Finals.

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:31,248
LeBron fueled the comeback. Allen kept their title hopes alive.

8
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:35,732
Legacy saved, or a chance to finish the job? You decide.
